Description: Joint conditional graphical lasso estimator for multiple
    conditional Gaussian graphical models with censored and/or missing values,
    as proposed in Sottile et al. (2025) <doi:10.1093/jrsssc/qlae052>. For each
    of K sub-populations, the package estimates a sparse precision matrix of the
    predictors, sparse regression coefficients and a sparse conditional precision
    matrix of the responses, with group lasso penalties that encourage similar
    structures across sub-populations. Estimation uses an EM algorithm with joint
    graphical lasso (ADMM) and accelerated proximal gradient steps. Model
    selection, maximum likelihood refitting, simulation of data and graph
    representations of the fitted models are also provided.
